    "header": "背景故事",
    "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left;\"></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"f449a83276bb0a07c943e51c419ef542\" title=\"克莱布拉松子爵的请柬.png\" alt=\"克莱布拉松子爵的请柬.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/arknights/webview/resource/pic/20220627/f449a83276bb0a07c943e51c419ef542.png\"/></div><p></p><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        致尊敬的客人：</span></span></em></span></h5><h5></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        鄙人的度假设施，克莱布拉松林地城堡已修建完毕。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        再过几日，便是高卢传统节日。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        在此，鄙人诚挚邀请您携家眷前来克莱布拉松，与我们一同欢庆。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        丰盛宴席、烟火表演，还有云游剧团倾情献艺，</span></span></em></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        想必一定能为各位带来一个值得铭记的夜晚。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        期待各位莅临。</span></span></em></span></h5><h5></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        您卑微的，克莱布拉松子爵</span></span></em></span></h5><h5 style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-family:SourceHanSerifCN-Medium\"><em><span style=\"font-size:1.125em\"><span style=\"color:#ffeed7\">        102X年X月X日</span></span></em></span></h5><p style=\"text-align:right;\"></p>",
    "displayTime": "2022-01-05",
